fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"vulkanlib/vkphysicaldevice.html#gst_vulkan_physical_device_check_api_version","fragment":"\n\tgst_vulkan_physical_device_check_api_version\n\n\n\tGstVulkan.VulkanPhysicalDevice.prototype.check_api_version\n\n\n\tGstVulkan.VulkanPhysicalDevice.check_api_version\n\nNote: This is the intersection of the exposed supported API version as would\nbe returned by gst_vulkan_physical_device_get_api_version and\ngst_vulkan_instance_check_version.  The latter will take into account any\nrequested API version and may result in a different result than directly\ncomparing against gst_vulkan_instance_get_version.\nParameters:\na GstVulkanPhysicalDevice\nthe API major version to check\nthe API minor version to check\nthe API patch version to check\nwhether the GstVulkanPhysicalDevice supports the version specified\nby major, minor and patch.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nNote: This is the intersection of the exposed supported API version as would\nbe returned by GstVulkan.VulkanPhysicalDevice.prototype.get_api_version and\nGstVulkan.VulkanInstance.prototype.check_version.  The latter will take into account any\nrequested API version and may result in a different result than directly\ncomparing against GstVulkan.VulkanInstance.prototype.get_version.\nParameters:\na GstVulkan.VulkanPhysicalDevice\nthe API major version to check\nthe API minor version to check\nthe API patch version to check\nwhether the GstVulkan.VulkanPhysicalDevice supports the version specified\nby major, minor and patch.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nNote: This is the intersection of the exposed supported API version as would\nbe returned by GstVulkan.VulkanPhysicalDevice.get_api_version and\nGstVulkan.VulkanInstance.check_version.  The latter will take into account any\nrequested API version and may result in a different result than directly\ncomparing against GstVulkan.VulkanInstance.get_version.\nParameters:\na GstVulkan.VulkanPhysicalDevice\nthe API major version to check\nthe API minor version to check\nthe API patch version to check\nwhether the GstVulkan.VulkanPhysicalDevice supports the version specified\nby major, minor and patch.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});